---
// The element StreakChip.tsx portals into. Pages compose this into PageShell's
// header slot; the home page puts it in the body, where its own script fills it.
//
// It carries both the id (the portal target) and the class (the styling hook, in
// app.css). Keeping them together in one component is what stops four pages
// agreeing on a magic string by accident.
---
<div id="streakChip" class="streak-chip"></div>
